    # Boundary-facing extensions are selected by markers lying outside on rows/columns
    # within the object's span: extend row/column through the empty outer side.
    # Each marker outside causes a full horizontal/vertical stripe at the corresponding
    # object-side boundary where no marker interrupts it.
    for r,c in marks:
